<StoryLayout story={story}>
  <div class="container">
    <section class="section" id="s01">
      <h2><span class="num">01 — CONTEXT</span>The Transcript</h2>
      <p>After Lindsay Waninger was terminated from Marathon Engineering during a video call, the Fireflies AI notetaker emailed her a link to the transcript. The transcript included a section from after she had dropped off the line.</p>
      <p>According to the complaint, that section contained a supervisor's description of the ideal replacement: "[h]opefully a relatively strapping young man."</p>
      <p>Waninger, an environmental scientist, had worked at Marathon Engineering — an environmental engineering firm in Logan Township, New Jersey — for fewer than three months before her termination. The termination meeting was conducted over video conference. A Fireflies AI bot was present in the call.</p>
<div class="nt-email">
